    "en": "Equation (12-1) gives a way to establish the unit of magnetic flux density.\n\nFor a uniform magnetic field, if the vector $\\vec{B}$ is perpendicular to a plane of area $S$, then $\\Phi=BS$.\n\nTherefore, if the magnetic flux through an area of 1 metre$^2$ is 1 weber, the magnitude of the magnetic flux density, measured in teslas, is 1."
